<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/rw-thousandhills.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Rwanda · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Rwanda in Full</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>10 days</b></span>
        <span>Volcanoes · Kivu · Nyungwe · Akagera</span>
        <span>Private &amp; tailor made</span>
        <span>from <b>$11,200</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Rwanda%20in%20Full" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="rwanda.html">Rwanda</a> / Rwanda in Full</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">The whole of this small, green country in one seamless journey, mountain gorillas in the Volcanoes, the famous canopy walk and chimpanzees of Nyungwe, the Big Five savanna of restored Akagera, and the calm, beautiful shores of Lake Kivu in between.</p>
        <p>Rwanda's compact size and superb roads make a grand tour surprisingly relaxed, every drive a scenic ribbon through the land of a thousand hills.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 10 day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Kigali</h3><p>Met at the airport for a tour of the capital, the moving Genocide Memorial, the Inema arts centre and a vibrant market.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kigali boutique hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To the Volcanoes</h3><p>Drive north through terraced hills to the foot of the Virungas, settling into your lodge with the volcanoes on the skyline.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking</h3><p>Into the forest with trackers ahead for a magical, regulated hour with a mountain gorilla family.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Volcanoes area lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Golden monkeys &amp; on to Lake Kivu</h3><p>A morning with the golden monkeys, then a scenic descent to the lakeside town of Gisenyi on the shores of Lake Kivu.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Kivu lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Lake Kivu at leisure</h3><p>A gentle day by one of Africa's great inland seas, a boat to the islands, a coffee farm visit, or simply rest on the shore.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Kivu lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>The Congo Nile trail to Nyungwe</h3><p>One of Africa's most beautiful drives, hugging the lake then climbing into the ancient rainforest of Nyungwe.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Nyungwe forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Nyungwe canopy &amp; chimps</h3><p>An early chimpanzee trek, then the thrilling canopy walkway suspended high above the forest, with views to the hills of Burundi.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Nyungwe forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 8</div><div class="day__body"><h3>East to Akagera</h3><p>Fly or drive across the country to Akagera National Park in the east, savanna, papyrus lakes and rolling plains, a complete change of scene.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Akagera tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 9</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Akagera Big Five</h3><p>A full day of game drives for lion, elephant, rhino and buffalo, plus an afternoon boat safari among hippo and birds on Lake Ihema.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Akagera tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 10</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return to Kigali &amp; depart</h3><p>Back to Kigali for a last lunch and your onward flight, having seen the whole of Rwanda.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
