        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Rwanda%20in%20Full"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>One&amp;Only Nyungwe House</h3><p>A tea estate lodge on the rainforest edge.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Rwanda%20in%20Full"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Magashi Camp</h3><p>Lakeside tents in wild Akagera.</p></div></a>
