          <li>All internal flights &amp; private transfers</li>
          <li>Hand picked lodges &amp; camps throughout</li>
          <li>One gorilla permit &amp; one chimpanzee permit</li>
          <li>Nyungwe canopy walk &amp; Akagera boat safari</li>
          <li>Expert driver guide &amp; all park fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Kigali city tour &amp; Lake Kivu excursion</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$11,200 per person sharing</strong>; single supplement available. International flights, visas and a second gorilla permit are extra. Rwanda's gorilla permit is premium priced and limited, we book early. Best in the drier months (June to September &amp; December to February); minimum age 15 for gorilla &amp; chimp trekking.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>All of Rwanda, beautifully woven.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and pace, and your designer will craft the grand tour around you.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Rwanda%20in%20Full" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
  </section>

